  "description": "“I, Evelyn Felice, hereby resign from my position as Empress. Gladly.” \n\nBound by the rigid rules of the imperial court and married to Fabian, a perfect yet cold husband, Evelyn closed her eyes in solitude after turning thirty. But when she opened them again… she had returned to the age of twenty. With the most precious person in the world in her arms, Evelyn chooses freedom. Yet before her, a relationship she thought she had completely severed begins to burn passionately once more.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/70754141)",
